# The wiki fetch cache. Regenerated by `npm run gather:refresh`.
# Deliberately NOT committed: it is an optimisation, and `gather --offline`
# fails loudly rather than silently using a stale or partial cache.
#
# NOTE: `public/data/` is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the committed snapshot
# the app loads, and committing it is what makes data changes reviewable as a diff.
.cache/

# Angular / Node
/node_modules
/dist
/.angular
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Tailwind + daisyUI output. Generated by `npm run tailwind:compile`, which the
# `prestart` and `prebuild` hooks already run, so a fresh clone builds without it.
# Not committed because it changes on nearly every template edit and would drown
# real changes in diff noise.
/src/tailwind.generated.css

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
